flowchart TD
  Human[👤 Developpeur humain]
  Maina[⚫ MAINa<br/>Maitre orchestrateur]
  Arcos[🟠 ARCos<br/>Architecture]
  Devon[🔵 DEVon<br/>Implementation]
  Qalvin[🟢 QALvin<br/>Tests / QA]
  Docly[🟣DOCly<br/>Documentation]
  Commands[Commandes / prompts<br/>/maina-help, /fleet, init, update]

  subgraph Deliverables[Livrables]
    ActionPlan[(Plan d'Action)]
    Architecture[(Recommandation architecture)]
    Adr[(ADR)]
    Code[(Code)]
    Tests[(Tests)]
    QaReport[(Rapport QA)]
    Documentation[(Documentation)]
    FinalSummary[(Synthese finale)]
  end

  Human -->|Cadre le besoin| Maina
  Human -->|Declenche commande optionnelle| Commands
  Commands -->|Contexte et regles workflow| Maina

  Maina -->|Delegue analyse architecture| Arcos
  Arcos -->|Recommandation, risques, impacts| Maina
  Arcos -->|Produit| Architecture
  Arcos -->|Decision structurante si requis| Adr

  Maina -->|Redige| ActionPlan
  Maina -->|Soumet plan a validation| Human
  Human -->|Valide / ajuste / refuse| Maina

  Maina -->|Delegue implementation validee| Devon
  Devon -->|Code source, config, scripts| Code
  Devon -->|Notifie fin implementation| Maina
  Maina -->|Demande validation implementation| Human
  Human -->|Validation ou corrections| Maina

  Maina -->|Corrections ciblees si besoin| Devon

  Maina -->|Delegue tests et validation| Qalvin
  Qalvin -->|Ecrit / ajuste| Tests
  Qalvin -->|Produit resultats commandes| QaReport
  Qalvin -->|Validation QA ou anomalies| Maina
  Maina -->|Corrections issues QA si besoin| Devon
  Devon -->|Correctifs| Code
  Maina -->|Soumet resultats QA| Human
  Human -->|Validation QA explicite| Maina

  Maina -->|Delegue synchronisation documentation| Docly
  Docly -->|README, ARCHITECTURE, guides| Documentation
  Docly -->|Met a jour si necessaire| Adr
  Docly -->|Notifie fin documentation| Maina

  Maina -->|Compile| FinalSummary
  Maina -->|Synthese finale des livrables| Human
  Human -->|Acceptation finale / ajustement| Maina

  ActionPlan -.->|Validation plan| Human
  Code -.->|Validation implementation| Human
  Tests -.->|Preuve de couverture| Human
  QaReport -.->|Validation QA| Human
  Documentation -.->|Documentation livree| Human
  Adr -.->|Decision tracee| Human
  FinalSummary -.->|Livraison finale| Human

  classDef human fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666666,color:#111111,stroke-width:2px
  classDef maina fill:#1f2937,stroke:#000000,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px
  classDef arcos fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#92400e,color:#111111,stroke-width:2px
  classDef devon fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#1e40af,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px
  classDef qalvin fill:#22c55e,stroke:#166534,color:#111111,stroke-width:2px
  classDef docly fill:#8b5cf6,stroke:#5b21b6,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px
  classDef command fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0369a1,color:#0f172a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef deliverable fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#c2410c,color:#7c2d12,stroke-width:2px

  class Human human
  class Maina maina
  class Arcos arcos
  class Devon devon
  class Qalvin qalvin
  class Docly docly
  class Commands command
  class ActionPlan,Architecture,Adr,Code,Tests,QaReport,Documentation,FinalSummary deliverable
